==Polish==
{{wp|lang=pl}}

===Etymology===
From earlier, medieval ''Warszewa'' or ''Warszowa'', from {{inh|pl|zlw-opl|Warsz}} + {{af|pl|-owa|pos1=adjectival suffix}}. ''Warsz'' is an {{der|pl|zlw-opl|-}} diminutive of the given name {{m|zlw-opl|Wrocisław}} or {{m|zlw-opl|Warcisław}} (cf. {{m|zlw-opl|Wrocław}}).

===Pronunciation===
